      "date": "2026-05-15T11:38:58.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹178 (vs ₹161 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹178 (up from ₹161 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹198.5b (up 7.0% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹12.4b (up 11% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.3% (up from 6.1% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 92% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 17% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
